      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, margin:",
          "value": "<p>Man\u1e63\u016br and his brothers, to my sisters and the boys, to all our friends, to the freedman, and Ma\u1e25\u0101sin (\"Favors\").</p>\n<p>Written on the 22nd of Iyyar, while the express caravan is on the point of leaving.</p>",
